faqs:
  - q: Is my client data HIPAA compliant with GullStack?
    a: We build HIPAA-mindful systems with encrypted data transmission, secure hosting, and privacy-first design. Our websites do not store protected health information (PHI) directly. For scheduling and intake forms, we integrate with HIPAA-compliant practice management systems you already use or recommend trusted partners that sign Business Associate Agreements.
  - q: How does 1% payment processing work for therapy practices?
    a: Most therapists use services like SimplePractice, IvyPay, or Square that charge 2.5-8% per transaction. On a $150 session, that is $4 to $12 gone every time. Our 1% processing rate means you keep more of every session. On 20 clients per week at $150 each, you save $3,000 to $7,000 per year compared to typical processors.
  - q: Can clients book appointments directly through my website?
    a: Yes. We build online booking directly into your website so clients can see your availability, choose a session type, and book instantly. Automatic confirmation emails and text reminders reduce no-shows. The system syncs with your calendar so you never get double-booked.
  - q: Will you help me show up when people search for a therapist near me?
    a: Absolutely. Local SEO is one of our core services. We optimize your Google Business Profile, build location-specific content, and structure your website so you rank for searches like therapist near me, counselor in your city, and anxiety therapist plus your area. Most of our therapy clients see meaningful ranking improvements within 60 to 90 days.
  - q: Do I need to switch my practice management system to work with GullStack?
    a: No. We integrate with the tools you already use including SimplePractice, TherapyNotes, Jane App, and others. Our systems complement your existing workflow rather than replacing it. We handle the marketing and business side so you can focus on your clients.
